  "translation": "Na bai i kamap: ol lain kantri na kingdom we ol i no wokim long ⟨את⟩ em — ⟨את⟩ Nevukadnetsar, king bilong Bavel — na ⟨את⟩ ol we ol i no putim nek bilong ol long jok bilong king bilong Bavel, bai mi kam lukaut long ol lain kantri olgeta wantaim bainat, na wantaim hangre, na wantaim sik nogut — Yahwe i tok — i go inap mi pinisim ⟨את⟩ olgeta long han bilong em.",
